sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Farmer
    participant W as Web app
    participant G as Gateway
    participant A as Farm-advisory service
    participant M as ML service
    U->>W: Enter N, P, K, temperature, humidity, pH, rainfall
    W->>W: Validate required values and ranges
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/predictions/crop
    G->>A: Forward (JWT validated)
    A->>M: POST /internal/v1/model1/predict (X-Internal-Token)
    M->>M: Range check, MinMax scale, Random Forest vote
    M->>M: SHAP factors for top 3 crops
    M-->>A: Top 3 crops, model score, factors, limitations
    A-->>G: 200 (nothing is stored)
    G-->>W: Response
    W-->>U: Show results labelled experimental, not a probability
